FnProxy packages an independently running NGINX Open Source executable.

NGINX version: 1.30.4 (stable)
NGINX source: https://nginx.org/

The source repository intentionally excludes generated Nginx executables and
FPK artifacts. The build scripts compile or accept a target-architecture Nginx
binary before packaging.

The FnProxy 0.1.0 x86 test package used a Debian 12 x86_64 build from the
official nginx-1.30.4 source archive. The FnProxy 0.1.0 ARM64 test package used
a statically linked AArch64 build produced by jirutka/nginx-binaries; its exact
source-input list is retained in third_party/nginx/arm64/.

